#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:410
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"\n"
"## See your English improvement over time\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal automatically tracks your performance after every conversation, "
"role play, and daily question answer. The Progress Chart turns that data "
"into a clear visual timeline so you can see where you started and how far "
"you have come.\n"
"\n"
"## What is measured\n"
"\n"
"After each practice session, the AI evaluates your response across four "
"metrics:\n"
"\n"
"- **Grammar** — accuracy of sentence structure and grammar rules\n"
"- **Vocabulary** — range and appropriateness of the words you use\n"
"- **Fluency** — how naturally and smoothly you express yourself\n"
"- **Confidence** — how assertive and clear your communication sounds\n"
"\n"
"Each metric is scored independently, so you get a detailed picture of your "
"strengths and the areas that still need work.\n"
"\n"
"## How the chart works\n"
"\n"
"The chart shows your scores on a daily timeline. You can:\n"
"- switch between metrics to focus on one skill at a time\n"
"- view different time periods: last 30 days, last 3 months, last 6 months, "
"or all time\n"
"- see a smoothed trend line that filters out day-to-day variation and "
"highlights your real direction of improvement\n"
"\n"
"## What the data shows\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal users who practice daily see an average increase of **5% per "
"month across all metrics**. That includes grammar accuracy, vocabulary "
"range, fluency, and speaking confidence.\n"
"\n"
"The chart makes that growth visible. Even small improvements become easy to "
"recognize when you can see the trend over weeks and months.\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"Progress tracking does more than record what happened. It shows you what is "
"working, keeps you motivated during slow periods, and helps you decide "
"where to focus next. When your chart shows momentum, it becomes easier to "
"keep the habit going."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"## Lihat peningkatan bahasa Inggris Anda dari waktu ke waktu\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal secara otomatis melacak kinerja Anda setelah setiap percakapan, "
"bermain peran, dan menjawab pertanyaan harian. Diagram Kemajuan mengubah "
"data tersebut menjadi garis waktu visual yang jelas sehingga Anda dapat "
"melihat dari mana Anda memulai dan seberapa jauh Anda telah berkembang.\n"
"\n"
"## Apa yang diukur\n"
"\n"
"Setelah setiap sesi latihan, AI mengevaluasi respons Anda berdasarkan empat "
"metrik:\n"
"\n"
"- **Tata bahasa** — ketepatan dalam struktur kalimat dan aturan tata bahasa\n"
"- **Kosakata** — jangkauan dan kesesuaian kata yang Anda gunakan\n"
"- **Kefasihan** — seberapa alami dan lancar Anda mengekspresikan diri\n"
"- **Kepercayaan diri** — seberapa tegas dan jelas komunikasi Anda terdengar\n"
"\n"
"Setiap metrik dinilai secara independen, sehingga Anda mendapatkan gambaran "
"yang terperinci tentang kekuatan Anda dan area yang masih memerlukan usaha.\n"
"\n"
"## Cara kerja diagram\n"
"\n"
"Diagram menunjukkan skor Anda pada garis waktu harian. Anda dapat:\n"
"- beralih antar metrik untuk fokus pada satu keterampilan pada satu waktu\n"
"- melihat periode waktu yang berbeda: 30 hari terakhir, 3 bulan terakhir, 6 "
"bulan terakhir, atau sepanjang waktu\n"
"- melihat garis tren yang dihaluskan yang menyaring variasi harian dan "
"menyoroti arah sejati peningkatan Anda\n"
"\n"
"## Apa yang ditunjukkan oleh data\n"
"\n"
"Pengguna FluencyPal yang berlatih setiap hari melihat peningkatan rata-rata "
"**5% per bulan di seluruh metrik**. Ini mencakup ketepatan tata bahasa, "
"jangkauan kosakata, kefasihan, dan kepercayaan diri berbicara.\n"
"\n"
"Diagram membuat pertumbuhan tersebut tampak. Bahkan perbaikan kecil menjadi "
"mudah dikenali ketika Anda dapat melihat tren selama berminggu-minggu dan "
"berbulan-bulan.\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ini membantu\n"
"\n"
"Pelacakan kemajuan lebih dari sekadar mencatat apa yang telah terjadi. Ini "
"menunjukkan kepada Anda apa yang berhasil, menjaga motivasi selama periode "
"lambat, dan membantu Anda memutuskan di mana harus fokus selanjutnya. "
"Ketika diagram Anda menunjukkan momentum, akan lebih mudah untuk "
"mempertahankan kebiasaan tersebut."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:206
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Create your own speaking scenario\n"
"\n"
"Custom Role Play lets you build a conversation around your own situation "
"instead of choosing only from predefined options.\n"
"\n"
"## What you can customize\n"
"\n"
"You can create role plays for:\n"
"- work meetings\n"
"- travel situations\n"
"- customer communication\n"
"- personal speaking challenges\n"
"- any specific English scenario you want to practice\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"This gives you more control over your learning and makes speaking practice "
"highly relevant to your real life.\n"
"\n"
"The result is personalized AI conversation practice that matches your exact "
"context."
msgstr ""
"## Buat skenario berbicara Anda sendiri\n"
"\n"
"Permainan Peran Kustom memungkinkan Anda membangun percakapan sekitar "
"situasi Anda sendiri, bukan hanya memilih dari opsi yang telah ditentukan "
"sebelumnya.\n"
"\n"
"## Apa yang dapat Anda sesuaikan\n"
"\n"
"Anda dapat membuat permainan peran untuk:\n"
"- pertemuan kerja\n"
"- situasi perjalanan\n"
"- komunikasi pelanggan\n"
"- tantangan berbicara pribadi\n"
"- skenario bahasa Inggris khusus apa pun yang ingin Anda latih\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ini membantu\n"
"\n"
"Ini memberi Anda lebih banyak kontrol atas pembelajaran Anda dan membuat "
"latihan berbicara sangat relevan dengan kehidupan nyata Anda.\n"
"\n"
"Hasilnya adalah latihan percakapan AI yang dipersonalisasi yang sesuai "
"dengan konteks Anda yang tepat."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:482
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Earn points and stay motivated\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal tracks your activity across the platform and rewards regular "
"practice with points.\n"
"\n"
"## How points are earned\n"
"\n"
"You can earn points through:\n"
"- AI conversations\n"
"- stories quizzes\n"
"- daily questions\n"
"- community activity\n"
"- game mode\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"The leaderboard creates a clear motivation loop for long-term consistency. "
"Top users can unlock rewards while they remain at the top.\n"
"\n"
"This makes progress more visible and practice more engaging."
msgstr ""
"## Dapatkan poin dan tetap termotivasi\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal melacak aktivitas Anda di seluruh platform dan memberikan poin "
"sebagai penghargaan untuk latihan rutin.\n"
"\n"
"## Cara mendapatkan poin\n"
"\n"
"Anda dapat mendapatkan poin melalui:\n"
"- percakapan AI\n"
"- kuis cerita\n"
"- pertanyaan harian\n"
"- aktivitas komunitas\n"
"- mode permainan\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ini membantu\n"
"\n"
"Papan peringkat menciptakan motivasi yang jelas untuk konsistensi jangka "
"panjang. Pengguna teratas dapat membuka hadiah saat mereka tetap berada di "
"peringkat atas.\n"
"\n"
"Ini membuat kemajuan lebih terlihat dan latihan lebih menarik."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:373
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Gamified English practice\n"
"\n"
"Game mode turns language learning into a set of interactive challenges that "
"reward regular practice.\n"
"\n"
"## Types of activities\n"
"\n"
"You can practice through tasks such as:\n"
"- translating words\n"
"- building sentences\n"
"- reading short texts\n"
"- answering speaking questions\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"You earn points for correct answers, which adds motivation and makes it "
"easier to stay consistent.\n"
"\n"
"Gamified learning helps improve vocabulary, reading, sentence building, and "
"speaking in a more engaging format."
msgstr ""
"## Latihan Bahasa Inggris dengan Permainan\n"
"\n"
"Mode permainan mengubah pembelajaran bahasa menjadi serangkaian tantangan "
"interaktif yang memberikan hadiah atas latihan yang teratur.\n"
"\n"
"## Jenis kegiatan\n"
"\n"
"Anda dapat berlatih melalui tugas seperti:\n"
"- menerjemahkan kata\n"
"- membangun kalimat\n"
"- membaca teks pendek\n"
"- menjawab pertanyaan berbicara\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ini membantu\n"
"\n"
"Anda mendapatkan poin untuk jawaban yang benar, yang menambah motivasi dan "
"memudahkan untuk tetap konsisten.\n"
"\n"
"Pembelajaran berbasis permainan membantu meningkatkan kosakata, membaca, "
"membangun kalimat, dan berbicara dalam format yang lebih menarik."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:94
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Grammar practice based on your real mistakes\n"
"\n"
"After conversations, FluencyPal creates a personalized grammar list based "
"on the errors you actually make while speaking or writing.\n"
"\n"
"## What each rule includes\n"
"\n"
"Each grammar item includes:\n"
"- a simple explanation\n"
"- clear examples\n"
"- a short quiz\n"
"- AI conversation practice for the same rule\n"
"\n"
"## Goal-aligned preparation\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal can also prioritize grammar patterns based on the kind of "
"English you need to use, such as:\n"
"- job interviews\n"
"- travel communication\n"
"- everyday conversations\n"
"- formal speaking\n"
"\n"
"## How the learning loop works\n"
"\n"
"You improve grammar in three steps:\n"
"1. understand the rule\n"
"2. practice it in a quiz\n"
"3. apply it in real conversation\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"This approach makes grammar practice more personal and more practical. "
"Instead of reviewing random rules, you focus on the patterns that are "
"slowing down your real English communication and the rules you are most "
"likely to need next."
msgstr ""
"## Latihan tata bahasa berdasarkan kesalahan nyata Anda\n"
"\n"
"Setelah percakapan, FluencyPal membuat daftar tata bahasa yang "
"dipersonalisasi berdasarkan kesalahan yang sebenarnya Anda buat saat "
"berbicara atau menulis.\n"
"\n"
"## Apa yang termasuk dalam setiap aturan\n"
"\n"
"Setiap item tata bahasa mencakup:\n"
"- penjelasan sederhana\n"
"- contoh yang jelas\n"
"- kuis singkat\n"
"- latihan percakapan AI untuk aturan yang sama\n"
"\n"
"## Persiapan sesuai tujuan\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal juga dapat memprioritaskan pola tata bahasa berdasarkan jenis "
"Bahasa Inggris yang perlu Anda gunakan, seperti:\n"
"- wawancara kerja\n"
"- komunikasi saat bepergian\n"
"- percakapan sehari-hari\n"
"- berbicara secara formal\n"
"\n"
"## Bagaimana siklus pembelajaran bekerja\n"
"\n"
"Anda meningkatkan tata bahasa dalam tiga langkah:\n"
"1. memahami aturannya\n"
"2. latihan dalam kuis\n"
"3. menerapkannya dalam percakapan nyata\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ini membantu\n"
"\n"
"Pendekatan ini membuat latihan tata bahasa lebih personal dan lebih "
"praktis. Alih-alih mengulas aturan acak, Anda fokus pada pola yang "
"memperlambat komunikasi Bahasa Inggris Anda yang sesungguhnya dan aturan "
"yang kemungkinan besar Anda perlukan selanjutnya."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:240
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Improve English through interactive stories\n"
"\n"
"With Stories, you listen to English content while reading the original text "
"and translation side by side.\n"
"\n"
"## How the quiz works\n"
"\n"
"After listening, you complete a quiz where you rebuild parts of the text "
"word by word. This helps you notice:\n"
"- sentence structure\n"
"- word order\n"
"- common language patterns\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"Stories combine reading, listening, and active reconstruction. This makes "
"them a practical alternative to passive content consumption and a useful "
"way to practice during commutes or short breaks."
msgstr ""
"## Tingkatkan Bahasa Inggris melalui cerita interaktif\n"
"\n"
"Dengan Cerita, Anda mendengarkan konten berbahasa Inggris sambil membaca "
"teks asli dan terjemahannya secara berdampingan.\n"
"\n"
"## Cara kerja kuis\n"
"\n"
"Setelah mendengarkan, Anda menyelesaikan kuis di mana Anda membangun "
"kembali bagian-bagian teks kata demi kata. Ini membantu Anda memperhatikan:\n"
"- struktur kalimat\n"
"- urutan kata\n"
"- pola bahasa yang umum\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ini membantu\n"
"\n"
"Cerita menggabungkan membaca, mendengarkan, dan rekonstruksi aktif. Ini "
"menjadikannya alternatif praktis untuk konsumsi konten pasif dan cara yang "
"berguna untuk berlatih selama perjalanan atau istirahat singkat."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:142
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Learn vocabulary that matches your goals\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal builds vocabulary lessons around the words that are most useful "
"for your personal goal and current level.\n"
"\n"
"## How it works\n"
"\n"
"At the start of each lesson, the system selects words that match:\n"
"- your learning objective\n"
"- your current vocabulary level\n"
"- the situations you want to handle in English\n"
"\n"
"Then the AI teacher explains the words and helps you use them in guided "
"conversation.\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"You do not just memorize isolated vocabulary. You practice words in "
"context, which makes them easier to remember and easier to use in real "
"speech.\n"
"\n"
"At the same time, FluencyPal continues improving your grammar guidance in "
"parallel."
msgstr ""
"## Belajar kosakata yang sesuai dengan tujuan Anda\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal membangun pelajaran kosakata berdasarkan kata-kata yang paling "
"berguna untuk tujuan pribadi Anda dan level Anda saat ini.\n"
"\n"
"## Bagaimana cara kerjanya\n"
"\n"
"Di awal setiap pelajaran, sistem memilih kata-kata yang sesuai dengan:\n"
"- tujuan belajar Anda\n"
"- tingkat kosakata Anda saat ini\n"
"- situasi yang ingin Anda tangani dalam bahasa Inggris\n"
"\n"
"Kemudian, guru AI menjelaskan kata-kata tersebut dan membantu Anda "
"menggunakannya dalam percakapan yang terarah.\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ini membantu\n"
"\n"
"Anda tidak hanya menghafal kosakata yang terisolasi. Anda melatih kata-kata "
"dalam konteks, yang membuatnya lebih mudah diingat dan lebih mudah "
"digunakan dalam percakapan nyata.\n"
"\n"
"Pada saat yang sama, FluencyPal terus meningkatkan panduan tata bahasa Anda "
"secara paralel."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:453
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Learn with other people\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal includes community chats where learners can interact beyond "
"one-on-one AI practice.\n"
"\n"
"## What you can do\n"
"\n"
"In the community, you can:\n"
"- ask questions\n"
"- share progress\n"
"- discuss learning challenges\n"
"- stay motivated with other learners\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"This adds a social layer to language learning and gives you more "
"opportunities to use English in meaningful ways.\n"
"\n"
"Some community functions may require age verification depending on the "
"feature."
msgstr ""
"## Belajar dengan orang lain\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal menyertakan obrolan komunitas di mana pelajar dapat berinteraksi "
"selain dari latihan AI satu-satu.\n"
"\n"
"## Apa yang bisa Anda lakukan\n"
"\n"
"Di komunitas, Anda dapat:\n"
"- mengajukan pertanyaan\n"
"- berbagi kemajuan\n"
"- mendiskusikan tantangan belajar\n"
"- tetap termotivasi dengan pelajar lain\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ini membantu\n"
"\n"
"Ini menambahkan lapisan sosial pada pembelajaran bahasa dan memberi Anda "
"lebih banyak kesempatan untuk menggunakan bahasa Inggris dengan cara yang "
"berarti.\n"
"\n"
"Beberapa fungsi komunitas mungkin memerlukan verifikasi usia tergantung "
"pada fitur."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:300
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Practice English with real current events\n"
"\n"
"The News feature turns today’s real headlines into English practice "
"material. Stories are pulled from gNews for your country, translated into "
"the language you are learning, and rewritten by AI at a complexity level "
"that matches your skill.\n"
"\n"
"## How it works\n"
"\n"
"Each day FluencyPal:\n"
"- fetches current news for your country (or any supported country you "
"choose)\n"
"- rewrites the article at three complexity levels so it stays readable for "
"you\n"
"- shows the story on your dashboard with the original image and a short "
"headline\n"
"\n"
"You can switch the news country and complexity level at any time from the "
"news settings.\n"
"\n"
"## Discuss the story with AI\n"
"\n"
"From the news card you can open the full article and start a voice or text "
"discussion about it with the AI tutor. The AI uses the article as the "
"topic, so you practice:\n"
"- expressing opinions about real events\n"
"- summarizing what you read\n"
"- asking and answering questions about the story\n"
"- using vocabulary that appears in everyday news\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"Real news gives you something fresh to talk about every day, which keeps "
"practice interesting and connected to the world you live in. Because the "
"text is rewritten at your level, you stay challenged without getting stuck "
"on unfamiliar wording, and the AI discussion turns a passive reading "
"session into active English speaking practice.\n"
"\n"
"Completing a news discussion also counts toward your daily tasks, so the "
"habit fits naturally into the rest of your learning routine."
msgstr ""
"## Berlatih Bahasa Inggris dengan kejadian terkini\n"
"\n"
"Fitur Berita mengubah berita utama terkini menjadi materi latihan bahasa "
"Inggris. Cerita diambil dari gNews untuk negara Anda, diterjemahkan ke "
"dalam bahasa yang Anda pelajari, dan ditulis ulang oleh AI pada tingkat "
"kompleksitas yang sesuai dengan kemampuan Anda.\n"
"\n"
"## Cara kerjanya\n"
"\n"
"Setiap hari FluencyPal:\n"
"- mengambil berita terkini untuk negara Anda (atau negara lain yang Anda "
"pilih dari daftar negara yang didukung)\n"
"- menulis ulang artikel tersebut pada tiga tingkat kompleksitas sehingga "
"tetap mudah dibaca untuk Anda\n"
"- menampilkan cerita di dasbor Anda dengan gambar asli dan judul singkat\n"
"\n"
"Anda dapat mengubah negara berita dan tingkat kompleksitas kapan saja dari "
"pengaturan berita.\n"
"\n"
"## Diskusikan cerita dengan AI\n"
"\n"
"Dari kartu berita Anda dapat membuka artikel lengkap dan memulai diskusi "
"suara atau teks tentangnya dengan tutor AI. AI menggunakan artikel sebagai "
"topik, sehingga Anda berlatih:\n"
"- mengekspresikan pendapat tentang kejadian nyata\n"
"- meringkas apa yang Anda baca\n"
"- bertanya dan menjawab pertanyaan tentang cerita\n"
"- menggunakan kosakata yang muncul dalam berita sehari-hari\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ini membantu\n"
"\n"
"Berita nyata memberi Anda sesuatu yang segar untuk dibicarakan setiap hari, "
"yang menjaga latihan tetap menarik dan terhubung dengan dunia tempat Anda "
"tinggal. Karena teks tersebut ditulis ulang sesuai level Anda, Anda tetap "
"merasa tertantang tanpa terjebak pada kata-kata yang tidak familiar, dan "
"diskusi AI mengubah sesi membaca pasif menjadi latihan berbicara bahasa "
"Inggris yang aktif.\n"
"\n"
"Menyelesaikan diskusi berita juga dihitung sebagai bagian dari tugas harian "
"Anda, sehingga kebiasaan ini akan secara alami sesuai dengan rutinitas "
"belajar Anda yang lain."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:172
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Practice real-life English scenarios\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal uses AI role plays to help you practice conversations that match "
"your real needs.\n"
"\n"
"## Goal-based role plays\n"
"\n"
"If your goal is related to work, your role plays may include:\n"
"- recruiter screening\n"
"- job interviews\n"
"- technical interviews\n"
"- salary discussions\n"
"\n"
"## Everyday speaking scenarios\n"
"\n"
"You also get ready-made role plays for practical communication, such as:\n"
"- shop conversations\n"
"- support calls\n"
"- everyday speaking situations\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"Role play practice helps you prepare for real conversations before they "
"happen. It makes English speaking practice more realistic, more useful, and "
"easier to transfer into everyday life."
msgstr ""
"## Latihan skenario bahasa Inggris kehidupan nyata\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal menggunakan peran AI untuk membantu Anda berlatih percakapan "
"yang sesuai dengan kebutuhan nyata Anda.\n"
"\n"
"## Peran berdasarkan tujuan\n"
"\n"
"Jika tujuan Anda terkait dengan pekerjaan, peran Anda mungkin mencakup:\n"
"- penyaringan perekrut\n"
"- wawancara kerja\n"
"- wawancara teknis\n"
"- diskusi gaji\n"
"\n"
"## Skenario berbicara sehari-hari\n"
"\n"
"Anda juga mendapatkan peran siap pakai untuk komunikasi praktis, seperti:\n"
"- percakapan di toko\n"
"- panggilan dukungan\n"
"- situasi berbicara sehari-hari\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ini membantu\n"
"\n"
"Latihan dengan peran membantu Anda mempersiapkan percakapan nyata sebelum "
"terjadi. Ini membuat latihan berbicara bahasa Inggris lebih realistis, "
"lebih berguna, dan lebih mudah ditransfer ke dalam kehidupan sehari-hari."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:266
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Practice speaking every day\n"
"\n"
"Daily Questions gives you one new English speaking prompt each day.\n"
"\n"
"## What you practice\n"
"\n"
"This feature helps you practice:\n"
"- expressing opinions\n"
"- organizing thoughts\n"
"- answering unexpected questions\n"
"- speaking with more confidence\n"
"\n"
"## Extra value\n"
"\n"
"You can also see answers from other learners, compare ideas, and discover "
"new ways to respond.\n"
"\n"
"This makes daily practice simple, consistent, and useful for real spoken "
"English."
msgstr ""
"## Latihan berbicara setiap hari\n"
"\n"
"Pertanyaan Harian memberikan Anda satu pembicaraan bahasa Inggris baru "
"setiap hari.\n"
"\n"
"## Yang Anda latih\n"
"\n"
"Fitur ini membantu Anda berlatih:\n"
"- mengungkapkan pendapat\n"
"- mengorganisasi pikiran\n"
"- menjawab pertanyaan tak terduga\n"
"- berbicara dengan lebih percaya diri\n"
"\n"
"## Nilai tambah\n"
"\n"
"Anda juga dapat melihat jawaban dari pelajar lain, membandingkan ide, dan "
"menemukan cara-cara baru untuk merespons.\n"
"\n"
"Ini membuat latihan harian menjadi sederhana, konsisten, dan berguna untuk "
"percakapan bahasa Inggris yang nyata."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:55
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Practice spoken English in different ways\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal gives you several ways to practice speaking English with AI, so "
"you can choose the format that fits your day, your confidence level, and "
"your learning style.\n"
"\n"
"## Available speaking modes\n"
"\n"
"### Call Mode\n"
"Talk naturally with an AI English tutor and follow the transcript during "
"the conversation.\n"
"\n"
"### Voice Message Mode\n"
"Record your answer, review AI suggestions, improve your response, and send "
"it when ready.\n"
"\n"
"### Chat Mode\n"
"Type your reply when speaking out loud is not convenient.\n"
"\n"
"## Extra support during conversation\n"
"\n"
"You can:\n"
"- adjust AI speaking speed\n"
"- use transcripts to follow the conversation\n"
"- get help when you do not know what to say next\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"While you practice, FluencyPal tracks mistakes and turns them into targeted "
"improvement tasks. This helps you improve English speaking confidence, "
"fluency, and speaking accuracy over time."
msgstr ""
"## Berlatih berbicara bahasa Inggris dengan berbagai cara\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal memberi Anda berbagai cara untuk berlatih berbicara bahasa "
"Inggris dengan AI, sehingga Anda dapat memilih format yang sesuai dengan "
"hari Anda, tingkat kepercayaan diri Anda, dan gaya belajar Anda.\n"
"\n"
"## Mode berbicara yang tersedia\n"
"\n"
"### Mode Panggilan\n"
"Berbicara secara alami dengan tutor bahasa Inggris AI dan ikuti transkrip "
"selama percakapan.\n"
"\n"
"### Mode Pesan Suara\n"
"Rekam jawaban Anda, tinjau saran AI, tingkatkan respons Anda, dan kirimkan "
"ketika siap.\n"
"\n"
"### Mode Obrolan\n"
"Ketik balasan Anda ketika berbicara dengan suara keras tidak memungkinkan.\n"
"\n"
"## Dukungan tambahan selama percakapan\n"
"\n"
"Anda dapat:\n"
"- menyesuaikan kecepatan berbicara AI\n"
"- menggunakan transkrip untuk mengikuti percakapan\n"
"- mendapatkan bantuan ketika Anda tidak tahu apa yang harus dikatakan "
"selanjutnya\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ini membantu\n"
"\n"
"Saat Anda berlatih, FluencyPal melacak kesalahan dan mengubahnya menjadi "
"tugas peningkatan yang terarah. Ini membantu Anda meningkatkan kepercayaan "
"diri berbicara bahasa Inggris, kefasihan, dan ketepatan berbicara seiring "
"waktu."

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:339
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## Structured debate practice with other learners\n"
"\n"
"Debates let you challenge other learners and practice spoken English in a "
"guided format.\n"
"\n"
"## How it works\n"
"\n"
"Both participants:\n"
"- receive the same questions\n"
"- record their answers\n"
"- submit responses to the system\n"
"\n"
"After that, FluencyPal selects a winner, explains the reasoning, and awards "
"points.\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"This format makes speaking with other people less stressful while still "
"helping you improve:\n"
"- clarity\n"
"- structure\n"
"- argumentation\n"
"- confidence in spoken English"
msgstr ""
"## Latihan debat terstruktur dengan peserta lain\n"
"\n"
"Debat memungkinkan Anda menantang peserta lain dan berlatih berbicara "
"bahasa Inggris dalam format terpandu.\n"
"\n"
"## Cara kerjanya\n"
"\n"
"Kedua peserta:\n"
"- menerima pertanyaan yang sama\n"
"- merekam jawaban mereka\n"
"- mengirimkan tanggapan ke sistem\n"
"\n"
"Setelah itu, FluencyPal memilih pemenang, menjelaskan alasannya, dan "
"memberikan poin.\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa ini membantu\n"
"\n"
"Format ini membuat berbicara dengan orang lain menjadi kurang stres sambil "
"tetap membantu Anda meningkatkan:\n"
"- kejelasan\n"
"- struktur\n"
"- argumentasi\n"
"- kepercayaan diri dalam berbicara bahasa Inggris"

#: src/features/Feature/featuresData.ts:22
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"## What it does\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal starts with a guided survey that helps create your personalized "
"English learning plan. This is not a marketing form. It is a practical step "
"that helps the AI understand your goal, your current level, and the areas "
"where you need the most support.\n"
"\n"
"## How it works\n"
"\n"
"You describe:\n"
"- what you want to achieve\n"
"- where you feel confident\n"
"- where you struggle\n"
"- what kind of English practice you need most\n"
"\n"
"Based on your answers, the AI asks follow-up questions and builds a plan "
"around your real goal.\n"
"\n"
"## Why it helps\n"
"\n"
"Your plan is not static. As you keep practicing, FluencyPal updates it to "
"reflect your progress, new weak points, and changing priorities.\n"
"\n"
"This makes your English conversation practice more focused, more practical, "
"and easier to apply in real conversations."
msgstr ""
"## Apa yang Dilakukan\n"
"\n"
"FluencyPal dimulai dengan survei yang dipandu yang membantu menciptakan "
"rencana belajar bahasa Inggris yang dipersonalisasi. Ini bukan formulir "
"pemasaran. Ini adalah langkah praktis yang membantu AI memahami tujuan "
"Anda, tingkat saat ini, dan area di mana Anda paling membutuhkan dukungan.\n"
"\n"
"## Bagaimana Cara Kerjanya\n"
"\n"
"Anda menggambarkan:\n"
"- apa yang ingin Anda capai\n"
"- di mana Anda merasa percaya diri\n"
"- di mana Anda mengalami kesulitan\n"
"- jenis latihan bahasa Inggris apa yang paling Anda butuhkan\n"
"\n"
"Berdasarkan jawaban Anda, AI akan mengajukan pertanyaan lanjutan dan "
"membangun rencana berdasarkan tujuan nyata Anda.\n"
"\n"
"## Mengapa Itu Membantu\n"
"\n"
"Rencana Anda tidak statis. Saat Anda terus berlatih, FluencyPal "
"memperbaruinya untuk mencerminkan kemajuan Anda, titik lemah baru, dan "
"prioritas yang berubah.\n"
"\n"
"Ini membuat latihan percakapan bahasa Inggris Anda lebih fokus, lebih "
"praktis, dan lebih mudah diterapkan dalam percakapan nyata."

#: src/features/Blog/blogData.tsx:362
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"**Introduction**  \n"
"Interviewing in a second language can feel daunting—especially when your "
"dream job is on the line. For intermediate English speakers, the pressure "
"to articulate skills and experiences clearly adds an extra layer of "
"challenge. But here’s the good news: *“With the right preparation, you can "
"turn a challenging interview into an opportunity to shine.”*  \n"
"\n"
"This guide is tailored for **Business English learners** aiming to excel in "
"interviews. Whether you’re applying for roles in tech, marketing, or "
"finance, follow these seven strategic steps to showcase your expertise with "
"confidence. Let’s dive in!  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Step 1: Research the Company and Role Thoroughly**  \n"
"Start by studying the company’s website, mission statement, and job "
"description—**in English**. This helps you:  \n"
"- Identify industry-specific terms (e.g., *“KPIs,” “ROI,” “agile "
"development”*).  \n"
"- Align your answers with the company’s values.  \n"
"\n"
"**Pro Tip:** Jot down keywords from the job posting (e.g., "
"*“cross-functional collaboration”*) and weave them into your responses. "
"This shows you speak the company’s language—literally!  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Step 2: Craft a Winning Self-Introduction**  \n"
"The “Tell me about yourself” question is your chance to make a stellar "
"first impression. Keep it concise (1–2 minutes) and structured:  \n"
"> *“I’m [Name], a [Job Title] with X years of experience in [Industry]. "
"Recently, I [Key Achievement]. I’m excited about this role because "
"[Alignment with Company Goals].”*  \n"
"\n"
"Practice until it feels natural—avoid sounding robotic!  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Step 3: Master Common Interview Questions**  \n"
"Prepare answers for these frequent questions:  \n"
"- *“What are your strengths?”*  \n"
"- *“Why do you want to work here?”*  \n"
"- *“Describe a challenge you overcame.”*  \n"
"\n"
"**Avoid memorizing scripts.** Instead, outline bullet points. For example:  "
"\n"
"> *Strength: Adaptable. Example: “I quickly learned new CRM software during "
"a team transition, improving workflow by 30%.”*  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Step 4: Boost Your Business English Vocabulary**  \n"
"Fluency in industry jargon is key. Use platforms like **PREPLY.COM** to "
"learn 5–10 role-specific terms. For a marketing role, master phrases like:  "
"\n"
"- *“Conversion funnel optimization”*  \n"
"- *“Customer retention metrics”*  \n"
"\n"
"Sprinkle these into answers to demonstrate professionalism.  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Step 5: Polish Pronunciation and Clarity**  \n"
"Even perfect grammar won’t help if you’re misunderstood. Focus on:  \n"
"- **Ending consonants** (e.g., pronounce the *“t”* in *“project”*).  \n"
"- **Intonation** (rise for questions, fall for statements).  \n"
"\n"
"**Try This:** Record yourself answering questions and note areas to "
"improve.  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Step 6: Simulate the Experience with Mock Interviews**  \n"
"Practice builds confidence. Partner with a friend, tutor, or use tools like "
"**FluencyPal** for AI-powered mock interviews. Real-time practice helps:  \n"
"- Reduce anxiety.  \n"
"- Identify tricky questions (e.g., *“Where do you see yourself in 5 "
"years?”*).  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Step 7: Prepare Questions + Final Touches**  \n"
"End strong with thoughtful questions:  \n"
"- *“What does success look like in this role?”*  \n"
"- *“How does the team collaborate on projects?”*  \n"
"\n"
"**Final Checklist:**  \n"
"- Lay out professional attire.  \n"
"- Plan your route to arrive early.  \n"
"- Practice polite phrases: *“Thank you for your time—it was a pleasure "
"meeting you.”*  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"**Conclusion**  \n"
"As an intermediate English speaker, your preparation is your superpower. By "
"researching, practicing, and refining your Business English skills, you’ll "
"walk into that interview ready to impress.  \n"
"\n"
"**Ready to Test Your Skills?**  \n"
"Simulate the real experience with a **free mock interview on "
"FluencyPal**—your final step to acing the big day!  \n"
msgstr ""
"**Pendahuluan**  \n"
"Wawancara dalam bahasa kedua bisa terasa menakutkan—terutama ketika "
"pekerjaan impian Anda dipertaruhkan. Bagi pembicara bahasa Inggris tingkat "
"menengah, tekanan untuk menjelaskan keterampilan dan pengalaman dengan "
"jelas menambah tantangan ekstra. Tapi berikut adalah berita baiknya: "
"*\"Dengan persiapan yang tepat, Anda dapat mengubah wawancara yang "
"menantang menjadi kesempatan untuk bersinar.\"*\n"
"\n"
"Panduan ini disesuaikan untuk **pelajar Bahasa Inggris Bisnis** yang "
"bertujuan untuk unggul dalam wawancara. Apakah Anda sedang melamar untuk "
"peran di teknologi, pemasaran, atau keuangan, ikuti tujuh langkah strategis "
"ini untuk memperlihatkan keahlian Anda dengan penuh percaya diri. Mari kita "
"mulai!\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Langkah 1: Teliti Perusahaan dan Peranan Secara Mendalam**  \n"
"Mulailah dengan mempelajari situs web perusahaan, misi, dan deskripsi "
"pekerjaan—**dalam bahasa Inggris**. Ini membantu Anda:\n"
"- Mengidentifikasi istilah spesifik industri (mis., *\"KPIs,\" \"ROI,\" "
"\"pengembangan agile\"*).\n"
"- Menyelaraskan jawaban Anda dengan nilai-nilai perusahaan.\n"
"\n"
"**Pro Tip:** Catat kata kunci dari lowongan pekerjaan (mis., *\"kolaborasi "
"lintas fungsional\"*) dan jalinlah ke dalam jawaban Anda. Ini menunjukkan "
"bahwa Anda berbicara dalam bahasa perusahaan—secara harafiah!\n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Langkah 2: Ciptakan Pengenalan Diri yang Menang**  \n"
"Pertanyaan \"Ceritakan tentang dirimu\" adalah kesempatan Anda untuk "
"membuat kesan pertama yang luar biasa. Pendekkan (1-2 menit) dan "
"strukturkan:\n"
"> *\"Saya [Nama], seorang [Jabatan] dengan pengalaman X tahun di "
"[Industri]. Baru-baru ini, saya [Pencapaian Utama]. Saya antusias tentang "
"peran ini karena [Sesuai dengan Tujuan Perusahaan].\"*  \n"
"\n"
"Latihlah sampai terasa alami—hindari terdengar seperti robot!  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Langkah 3: Kuasai Pertanyaan Wawancara Umum**  \n"
"Siapkan jawaban untuk pertanyaan sering ini:  \n"
"- *\"Apa kelebihanmu?\"*  \n"
"- *\"Mengapa Anda ingin bekerja di sini?\"*  \n"
"- *\"Jelaskan tantangan yang telah Anda atasi.\"*  \n"
"\n"
"**Hindari menghapal naskah.** Sebagai gantinya, buatlah poin inti. "
"Misalnya:  \n"
"> *Kekuatan: Adaptable. Contoh: \"Saya cepat mempelajari perangkat lunak "
"CRM baru selama transisi tim, meningkatkan aliran kerja sebesar 30%.\"*  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Langkah 4: Tingkatkan Kosakata Bahasa Inggris Bisnis Anda**  \n"
"Penguasaan istilah industri adalah kuncinya. Gunakan platform seperti "
"**PREPLY.COM** untuk mempelajari 5-10 istilah spesifik peran. Untuk peran "
"pemasaran, kuasai frasa seperti:  \n"
"- *\"Optimisasi corong konversi\"*  \n"
"- *\"Metrik retensi pelanggan\"*  \n"
"\n"
"Taburkan ini ke dalam jawaban untuk menunjukkan profesionalisme.  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Langkah 5: Menghaluskan Pelafalan dan Kejelasan**  \n"
"Meskipun tata bahasa sempurna juga tidak akan membantu jika Anda "
"disalahpahami. Fokuslah pada:  \n"
"- **Huruf konsonan akhir** (mis., ucapkan *\"t\"* dalam *\"project\"*).  \n"
"- **Intonasi** (naik untuk pertanyaan, turun untuk pernyataan).  \n"
"\n"
"**Coba Ini:** Rekam diri Anda menjawab pertanyaan dan catat area yang perlu "
"ditingkatkan.  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Langkah 6:Simulasikan Pengalaman dengan Mock Interview**  \n"
"Praktik membangun kepercayaan diri. Bekerja sama dengan teman, tutor, atau "
"gunakan alat seperti **FluencyPal** untuk simulasi wawancara berbasis AI. "
"Praktik real-time membantu:  \n"
"- Mengurangi kecemasan.  \n"
"- Mengidentifikasi pertanyaan rumit (mis., *\"Kamu melihat dirimu bagaimana "
"dalam 5 tahun ke depan?\"*).  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"### **Langkah 7: Siapkan Pertanyaan + Sentuhan Terakhir**  \n"
"Akhir yang kuat dengan pertanyaan yang bijaksana:  \n"
"- *\"Bagaimana gambaran sukses dalam peran ini?\"*  \n"
"- *\"Bagaimana tim berkolaborasi dalam proyek-proyek?\"*  \n"
"\n"
"**Checklist Akhir:**  \n"
"- Siapkan pakaian profesional.  \n"
"- Rencanakan rute Anda untuk datang lebih awal.  \n"
"- Latihlah kalimat sopan: *\"Terima kasih atas waktunya—sangat menyenangkan "
"bertemu dengan Anda.\"*  \n"
"\n"
"---\n"
"\n"
"**Kesimpulan**  \n"
"Sebagai pembicara bahasa Inggris tingkat menengah, persiapan Anda adalah "
"kekuatan super Anda. Dengan melakukan penelitian, berlatih, dan memperhalus "
"keterampilan Bahasa Inggris Bisnis Anda, Anda akan masuk ke wawancara "
"dengan siap untuk mengesankan.\n"
"\n"
"**Siap Untuk Menguji Kemampuan Anda?**  \n"
"Simulasikan pengalaman nyata dengan **wawancara simulasi gratis di "
"FluencyPal**—langkah terakhir Anda untuk menguasai hari besar!"

