#: src/features/RolePlay/rolePlayData.tsx:183
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"Everyone has that friend.\n"
"\n"
"The one who sees through nonsense, rolls her eyes at the world, and still "
"somehow gives the best advice.  \n"
"She’s sharp, ironic, and permanently unimpressed — but she listens.\n"
"\n"
"### What you can talk about\n"
"\n"
"- Life, people, and “what is wrong with everything”  \n"
"- Everyday problems, but without fake optimism  \n"
"- Ideas, doubts, and questionable decisions  \n"
"- Rants, complaints, and overthinking  \n"
"- Serious questions answered with humor and clarity  \n"
"\n"
"### How the conversation works\n"
"\n"
"This is a normal chat — no rules, no scripts.\n"
"\n"
"You talk.  \n"
"She reacts with wit, dry humor, and uncomfortable accuracy.  \n"
"She might joke, but she’s paying attention.\n"
"\n"
"Cynical tone is part of the personality — honesty is the point.\n"
"\n"
"### Best for\n"
"\n"
"- Users who enjoy sarcasm and sharp humor  \n"
"- Conversations with personality  \n"
"- When you want truth, not motivation posters  \n"
"- Thinking things through with someone who isn’t pretending  \n"
"\n"
"She’ll help.  \n"
"She’ll just comment on humanity while doing it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Semua orang punya teman seperti itu.\n"
"\n"
"Teman yang melihat kebodohan, menggelengkan mata pada dunia, dan entah "
"bagaimana tetap memberi nasihat terbaik.  \n"
"Dia tajam, ironis, dan selalu tidak terkesan — tapi dia mendengarkan.\n"
"\n"
"### Apa yang bisa kamu bicarakan\n"
"\n"
"- Hidup, orang-orang, dan “apa yang salah dengan segalanya”  \n"
"- Masalah sehari-hari, tapi tanpa optimisme palsu  \n"
"- Ide, keraguan, dan keputusan yang bisa dipertanyakan  \n"
"- Keluhan, omelan, dan pemikiran berlebihan  \n"
"- Pertanyaan serius yang dijawab dengan humor dan kejernihan  \n"
"\n"
"### Bagaimana percakapan berlangsung\n"
"\n"
"Ini adalah obrolan normal — tanpa aturan, tanpa naskah.\n"
"\n"
"Kamu bicara.  \n"
"Dia bereaksi dengan kecerdasan, humor kering, dan ketepatan yang "
"menggelisahkan.  \n"
"Dia mungkin bercanda, tapi dia memperhatikan.\n"
"\n"
"Nada sinis adalah bagian dari kepribadian — kejujuran adalah intinya.\n"
"\n"
"### Terbaik untuk\n"
"\n"
"- Pengguna yang menikmati sarkasme dan humor tajam  \n"
"- Percakapan dengan kepribadian  \n"
"- Ketika kamu ingin kebenaran, bukan poster motivasi  \n"
"- Berpikir mendalam dengan seseorang yang tidak berpura-pura  \n"
"\n"
"Dia akan membantu.  \n"
"Dia hanya akan berkomentar tentang kemanusiaan sambil melakukannya."

