#: src/features/Blog/blogData.tsx:73
#. js-lingui-explicit-id
msgid ""
"I recognize this feeling.\n"
"\n"
"I know my own stranger can be wrong. It happens. But rarely enough that "
"questioning him feels awkward. When his answers are structured, articulate, "
"confident, I hesitate. Asking, “Are you absolutely sure?” can feel almost "
"inappropriate — as if I am wasting his time, or exposing my own ignorance.\n"
"\n"
"My stranger is not a person.\n"
"\n"
"We usually call him ChatGPT. And that is where the parallel becomes "
"difficult to ignore.\n"
"\n"
"On the surface, he is easier to “read” than any human being. His tone is "
"stable. His politeness is predictable. His structure is clean. There are no "
"trembling hands, no nervous pauses, no visible signs of hesitation.\n"
"\n"
"That stability may itself create a problem.\n"
"\n"
"In humans, inner doubt often leaks into outward expression. We hear it in "
"hesitation, see it in posture, sense it in tone. With AI, that link is "
"absent. Its voice remains steady regardless of uncertainty. The certainty "
"you hear comes from the way it is built.\n"
"\n"
"You can ask it how to cook “pork wings,” and it may calmly provide a recipe "
"- even if the premise itself is absurd."
msgstr ""
"Saya mengenali perasaan ini.\n"
"\n"
"Saya tahu orang asing saya sendiri bisa salah. Itu terjadi. Namun jarang "
"sekali sehingga mempertanyakannya terasa canggung. Ketika "
"jawaban-jawabannya terstruktur, artikulatif, percaya diri, saya ragu-ragu. "
"Menanyakan, \"Apakah Anda benar-benar yakin?\" bisa terasa hampir tidak "
"pantas - seolah-olah saya membuang-buang waktunya, atau memperlihatkan "
"kebodohan saya sendiri.\n"
"\n"
"Orang asing saya bukanlah seseorang.\n"
"\n"
"Kami biasanya memanggilnya ChatGPT. Dan di situlah paralel menjadi sulit "
"diabaikan.\n"
"\n"
"Di permukaan, dia lebih mudah \"dibaca\" daripada manusia mana pun. Nadanya "
"stabil. Kesopanannya dapat diprediksi. Strukturnya bersih. Tidak ada tangan "
"yang gemetar, tidak ada jeda gugup, tidak ada tanda-tanda keraguan yang "
"terlihat.\n"
"\n"
"Stabilitas itu sendiri mungkin menciptakan masalah.\n"
"\n"
"Pada manusia, keraguan batin sering kali merembes ke dalam ekspresi "
"lahiriah. Kita mendengarnya dalam keragu-raguan, melihatnya dalam postur, "
"merasakannya dalam nada. Pada AI, hubungan itu tidak ada. Suaranya tetap "
"stabil terlepas dari ketidakpastian. Kepastian yang Anda dengar berasal "
"dari cara ia dibangun.\n"
"\n"
"Anda bisa menanyakan cara memasak \"sayap babi\", dan ia mungkin dengan "
"tenang memberikan resep - bahkan jika premisnya sendiri adalah absurd."

